// Placeholder so niri's `include "noctalia.kdl"` resolves on a fresh machine before
// Noctalia has run for the first time.
//
// Noctalia overwrites this file with the active palette's colors (focus-ring, border,
// shadow, tab-indicator, insert-hint, recent-windows) every time the color scheme
// changes - that's its builtin "niri" theme template. The `create_` prefix means
// chezmoi writes this file once, if it is missing, and never touches it again, so
// those generated colors are never clobbered by `chezmoi apply`.
